OL,3,GNEWSARed wind warning issued for
OL,4,AChannel Islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FA red weather warning for wind has been
OL,7,Fissued in the Channel Islands ahead of
OL,8,FStorm Austen.
OL,10,FJersey Met has forecast very strong
OL,11,Fwinds with gusts reaching 75mph
OL,12,F(120km/h) and potentially up to 85mph,
OL,13,Fwith the strongest winds expected early
OL,14,Fon Friday.
OL,16,FAll Government of Jersey schools would
OL,17,Fbe closed on Friday and islanders were
OL,18,Fadvised to avoid outdoor activity where
OL,19,Fpossible, officials said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
